@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/scenarios

### 1. Create Optimization Scenario linking Vehicles and Deliveries (ManyToMany)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Bucharest Sector 1 High-Density Route",
  "vehicleIds": [1],
  "deliveryIds": [1]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("lastScenarioId", response.body.id);
%}

### 2. List All Scenarios
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Scenario by ID (Fetches Many-to-Many vehicleIds and deliveryIds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{lastScenarioId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Search Scenarios by Keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?keyword=Sector
Accept: application/json

### 5. Update Scenario Associations
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{lastScenarioId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Bucharest Sector 1 High-Density Route - Updated",
  "vehicleIds": [1],
  "deliveryIds": []
}

### 6. Delete Scenario
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{lastScenarioId}}
